<title>SWEDEN: Swedish unemployment rate falls to 7.6 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Swedish unemployment rate falls to 7.6 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Sweden fell to 7.6 percent in October from 8.3 percent in September, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 OCT 96	SEPT 96    OCT 95</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 7.6	   8.3	  7.6</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 326,000     354,000    327,000</p>
<p>NOTE - A Reuters poll of economists showed the market had expected an unemployment rate of 8.0 percent in October.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
